  "description": {
    "raw": "You transform the target weapon into pure blightburn. The\nweapon functions as normal, but any creature that touches it,\nor that it strikes, takes 2d6 points of fire damage each round it\nremains in contact. In addition, the weapon emanates an aura of\nradiation that causes blightburn sickness. This is as the disease\n(see page 29), but with a 10-foot radius and a save DC equal to\nthis spell’s save DC.",
    "search_text": "\"you transform the target weapon into pure blightburn. the\\nweapon functions as normal, but any creature that touches it,\\nor that it strikes, takes 2d6 points of fire damage each round it\\nremains in contact. in addition, the weapon emanates an aura of\\nradiation that causes blightburn sickness. this is as the disease\\n(see page 29), but with a 10-foot radius and a save dc equal to\\nthis spell’s save dc.\"",
